{"turn_id": "d18-t1", "session_id": "d18", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "training_data_el_quijote", "text": "模型使用 El Quijote 语料训练，该语料包含塞万提斯17世纪西班牙语小说原文及其对应的21世纪版本。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.03355", "chunk_id": "c-2b39005de67979a14fc26cd7"}]}, {"key": "training_data_dutch_bible", "text": "另一个用于实验的语料是荷兰语《圣经》，其中包括1637年版（被视为原始文档）和1888年版（被视为现代荷兰语）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.03355", "chunk_id": "c-2b39005de67979a14fc26cd7"}]}, {"key": "el_conde_lucanor_test_only", "text": "El Conde Lucanor 因语料规模较小，仅被用作测试集；由于找不到合适的训练语料，研究者改用为 El Quijote 构建的系统来现代化该文档。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.03355", "chunk_id": "c-2b39005de67979a14fc26cd7"}]}, {"key": "small_corpus_size", "text": "研究中指出训练语料规模较小，并认为这可能是 NMT 方法表现不佳的原因之一。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.03355", "chunk_id": "c-98f92e50001a68c58a20c08e"}]}, {"key": "future_enrich_corpus", "text": "作为未来工作，作者希望探索用额外数据丰富训练语料的技术。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.03355", "chunk_id": "c-e242628d1556d3af58dbaeaa"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d18-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
